      "mutation_type": "Germline",
      "description": "Biallelic variants in FZD5 can cause microphthalmia (abnormally small eyes), sometimes with coloboma and additional phenotypes. FZD5 mutant models show genetically sensitized development of microphthalmia and coloboma."
    },
